BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 483.4 Td (  reusable identity. A producer/consumer artifact is verified by its content identity;) Tj ET
BT /F3 9.2 Tf 52 470.1 Td (  missing, overwritten, or mismatched artifacts block reuse.) Tj ET
